78
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:56,423
[Host] That's all for today. EV sales in Japan more than doubled in the first half of the year, reaching about sixty thousand units and a record three percent of new passenger cars, led by Toyota's bZ4X, thanks to new models and bigger government subsidies. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

79
